-- words --
An unknown example is refused: an agent adds a finding whose evidence names the example G-ONE line-1/z, which the commit HEAD does not hold; the add is refused as a rule, exit 1, and the refusal names the example.
-- run --
hyp finding add --fact 'nothing shows' --evidence 'seen in a run' --example G-ONE/line-1/z --commit HEAD 2>&1; echo "add exit: $?"
-- floor: contains --
line-1/z
-- floor: contains --
add exit: 1
